%% Event Flow Diagram — reference flows expanded
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant L1 as api_handler Lambda
    participant DDB as DynamoDB (orders)
    participant EB as EventBridge Bus
    participant SQ as SQS (orders queue)
    participant L2 as orders_worker Lambda
    participant DLQ as DLQ

    C->>AG: POST /orders
    AG->>L1: AWS_PROXY invoke
    L1->>DDB: PutItem (status=RECEIVED)
    L1->>EB: PutEvents (OrderCreated)
    AG-->>C: 201 {order_id}
    EB->>SQ: Rule target (orders-domain-events)
    SQ->>L2: Event source mapping (batch)
    alt processing succeeds
        L2->>DDB: UpdateItem (status=PROCESSED)
    else processing fails after maxReceiveCount retries
        SQ->>DLQ: Message moved to DLQ
        Note over DLQ: runbooks/dlq-handling.md
    end
